      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Now I have a clear picture. The key improvements needed are:\n1. Remove unused data provider methods and their associated unused imports — they add significant clutter to this focused comparison test\n2. Break the long single-line call in `test_comparisons` into one instant per line\n3. Improve variable naming in `doTest_comparisons_TaiInstant` to make comparisons clearerNow I'll run the compile check.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored file removes all unused data-provider methods and imports, renames the loop variables to `earlier`/`later` for clarity, adds a brief Javadoc on the helper, and formats the 13-argument call in `test_comparisons` with one instant per line — preserving identical runtime behaviour throughout."
